{"unit_id":"Final-LX__dsh-ui-customizer#feature-1","repo":"Final-LX/dsh-ui-customizer","commit":"eb6b713ac2b677eb011fe6ede8491970d6ea18d0","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-ui-customizer 的功能「预设皮肤」：用户可在 DIY 主题面板中选择内置皮肤，立即试穿配色方案；确认后点击“应用”保存，也可还原未保存的改动。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/client.js:934"]}
{"unit_id":"Final-LX__dsh-ui-customizer#feature-2","repo":"Final-LX/dsh-ui-customizer","commit":"eb6b713ac2b677eb011fe6ede8491970d6ea18d0","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-ui-customizer 的功能「外观调节」：用户可修改品牌、强调、成功、警告和错误色，并调整界面字体、代码字体、缩放比例、中性色调、阴影与圆角。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/client.js:515"]}
{"unit_id":"Final-LX__dsh-ui-customizer#feature-3","repo":"Final-LX/dsh-ui-customizer","commit":"eb6b713ac2b677eb011fe6ede8491970d6ea18d0","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-ui-customizer 的功能「自定义背景」：用户可设置图片或视频背景并调整面板透明度和模糊程度；上传媒体存入 IndexedDB，外链图片可使用 HTTP(S) 地址。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/client.js:174"]}
{"unit_id":"Final-LX__dsh-ui-customizer#feature-4","repo":"Final-LX/dsh-ui-customizer","commit":"eb6b713ac2b677eb011fe6ede8491970d6ea18d0","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-ui-customizer 的功能「命名方案」：用户可将当前主题配置保存为命名方案，之后应用或删除方案；方案配置存放在浏览器的 localStorage。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/client.js:993"]}
{"unit_id":"Final-LX__dsh-ui-customizer#caveat-1","repo":"Final-LX/dsh-ui-customizer","commit":"eb6b713ac2b677eb011fe6ede8491970d6ea18d0","type":"caveat","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-ui-customizer 使用前须知：主题配置和命名方案写入浏览器 localStorage，上传的图片或视频保存在 IndexedDB，因此不同浏览器之间不会自动共享这些设置。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/client.js:143","lib/client.js:167","lib/client.js:190"]}
